{"sections":[{"slug":"杨--Mills联络","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"杨--Mills联络"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“杨–Mills 联络”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\nabla$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">是指其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率形式</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$$\r\n\\nabla^* R = 0.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\nabla^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">是其形式伴随</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">这等价于</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/调和形式","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">调和形式</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>$4$ <span lang=\"zh\">维情形的杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">方程可表示为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">反</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">自对偶性</span> $\\star R = \\pm R$, <span lang=\"zh\">此时称</span> $\\nabla$ (<span lang=\"zh\">反</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">自对偶</span>.</p>\n<p>Atiyah–Singer <span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>\n$$\r\nSD :=\\{\\nabla: \\nabla \\text{自对偶} \\}\\big/ \\text{规范等价}\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Uhlenbeck <span lang=\"zh\">紧化</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">是有限维流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/配边","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">配边</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">类不依赖于</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量的选取</span>. Donaldson <span lang=\"zh\">证明某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/示性类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">示性类</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\beta$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $SD$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的积分是</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">的微分不变量</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">只取决于微分结构</span>). "},{"Local":{"url":"/Seiberg--Witten方程","text":"Seiberg–Witten <span lang=\"zh\">方程</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类了</span> $4$ <span lang=\"zh\">维微分结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Donaldson <span lang=\"zh\">不变量相等</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">联络是杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">泛函的临界点</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}